This line has equation,  $y=-3x+5$  and intersects  $y=1$  at  $x=\tfrac{4}{3}.$  So, we want to find everything to the left of this line that lies within the rectangle which becomes a trapezoid, so  $$ \left(\frac{4}{3}+\frac{5}{3}\right) \cdot \frac{1}{2}=\frac{3}{2} $$  Dividing by  $2$  since that is the area of the rectangle we get  $\boxed{\tfrac{3}{4}}.$</details>

